40
00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:27.053
Scientists put animals into groups. A dog is a mammal and a snake is a reptile. A frog is an amphibian: it lives in water and on land. A cow is a herbivore because it eats plants. A lion is a carnivore and a predator. Bears are omnivores.

